    "grounding_mode": "contextual_synthesis",
    "text": "Separation is a component of unsupervised cluster evaluation measures used to help determine the number of clusters in partitional clustering algorithms such as K-means; it is associated with maximizing SSB and suffers when clusters are split too finely.",
